<https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description/hasGarmentAnalysis> a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "has garment analysis"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "This property relates an ancient or contemporary garment to the technical definition of textured fabrics, according to the standard provided by C.I.E.T.A., or laces. It can represent the dinstinction between plain fabric and textured fabric."@en ;
